      "example": "100XXXX",
      "help_en": "Platform session ID, which uniquely identifies a session in the platform.\n\nNote: Either PlatformSessionId or CustomSessionId must be specified. If both parameters are set, PlatformSessionId takes precedence",
      "help_zh": "平台会话ID，在平台中唯一标识一个会话。\n\n注意：PlatformSessionId和CustomSessionId必须二选一。 如果同时设置了两个参数，以PlatformSessionId为准",
